nts, but all the other HPND variants require both to appear in supporting documentation and/or only the copyright notice to appear in \"all copies\"_    \r\n\r\n`and the name of INRIA, IMAG, or any contributor \r\nnot be used in advertising or publicity pertaining to this material \r\nwithout the prior explicit permission.` \r\n_\"pertaining to this material\" instead of the usual \"pertaining to the distribution of the software\" \r\n\"explicit\" instead of \"written\" permission_\r\n\r\n`The software is provided \"as is\" without any warranties, support or liabilities of any kind.`\r\n_this is unique in that it adds \"support or liabilities\"_\r\n    \r\n`This software is derived from source code from \"University of California at Berkeley\" and \"Digital Equipment Corporation\" protected by copyrights.`\r\n_this is also unique_","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1900761408/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1909415085","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2319#issuecomment-1909415085","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2319","id":1909415085,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85xz1yt","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http